    <h1>Commercial Disclosure</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <h2>Why This Page Exists</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica may earn income from digital products, agricultural products, partnerships, referrals, advertising or other commercial activities. We disclose commercial relationships so readers can understand how the website may be funded.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>Some future links may be affiliate links. If you purchase through an affiliate link, GoOrganicAfrica may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. We aim to recommend or reference services because they may be useful to readers, not solely because a commission is available.</p>
    <h2>Our Own Products</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica may reference or sell agricultural guides, training, farm-input products or related services. Such material is commercial content where applicable and should be evaluated on its own merits.</p>
    <h2>Sponsored Content</h2>
    <p>If sponsored or paid promotional content is published, we will identify it clearly. Sponsorship does not automatically mean that every claim made by a sponsor is independently verified by GoOrganicAfrica.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Advertising may appear alongside editorial content if the website is approved for an advertising network. Advertisements are separate from our editorial content, and readers should independently evaluate advertised products and services.</p>
